  "body": "The device-list-tracking code makes *lots* of requests to methods like `get_users_in_room` and `get_rooms_for_user`, which are likely to return completely bogus results during a faster join. This brings danger of bugs where we think we have up-to-date device lists for particular users, but actually don't, leading to E2EE failures.\r\n\r\nSo, the work needed here is to (a) understand how device list tracking works; (b) ensure that it will end up correct (even if it's not entirely correct *during* a faster join).",
